         <pdf:Keywords>Hygiene Standards: Strict adherence to CIP (Clean-in-place) protocols and tank sterilization., Barrel Management: Filling, emptying, high-pressure cleaning, and steaming., Safety Awareness: Committed to Work Health and Safety (WHS) regulations and proper PPE usage., Flotation Specialization: Expert operation of batch and continuous flotation units (setup, monitoring, troubleshooting)., Cellar Operations: Proficient in pump overs, tank transfers, additions, sparging, and hose management.</pdf:Keywords>
