         <rms:rms_summary>Reliable and versatile Experienced Cellar Hand with 4 completed vintages across Australia and New Zealand. Specialized in flotation operations and fermentation management, with a strong commitment to winery safety and hygiene standards. Proven ability to integrate quickly into diverse teams and maintain high performance operational standards during peak harvest periods. Seeking to leverage extensive harvest experience to support the production team in delivering high-quality wine.</rms:rms_summary>
